# WP-ACTIVATE-SLICED (owner 11-17, "World Partition to the end"; AUDIT-WP-1104): a cell becomes entities a SLICE at a
# time - runs of whole composites, timed on the clock, sized by the measured cost of each record kind
# (Core/Serialize/WorldPartitionActivationCost.hpp) - until the frame's ActivationBudgetMs is spent; its entities stay
# hidden (ECS::StreamingPendingComponent) until every record is made AND every Jolt body of the cell exists, so
# "Activated" = drawn and collidable at once (UE UWorld::AddToWorld / ULevel::IncrementalRegisterComponents +
# CreatePhysicsState at registration). The CRITICAL block (loading overlay) lifts only on that frame.
# World: Scenes/WP_Protocol (WP-PROTOCOL.scn): Main 25 m cells / 200 m range. The heavy cell: the Main cell beside the
# route of the Player 9000001 that holds ~2000 records - the lead picks it from the WP map (Load All, the cell's record
# count in its tooltip) and puts its centre in HEAVY below; if WP_Protocol has none that dense, the scene gets one from
# assets (a prefab block copied in the editor), not from code.
# Expected (editor.log "[WorldPartition] 'WP_Protocol': ..."):
#   walk-up: "<cell> activated in N frames: ~2000 record(s) in K slice(s), X ms on the main thread, collision ready"
#            with N > 1; the frame-time HUD shows no frame above ActivationBudgetMs (2 ms) + the ordinary frame;
#            the cell pops in whole (never half a block), its HLOD drawn until that frame;
#   teleport: "play waits for it" then "play resumes" - and on the first resumed frame the player stands on the floor of
#            the cell (no fall, Y unchanged across the next frames); at the end of Play the per-kind line
#            "... per kind: static mesh 0.0xxx ms, physics 0.0xxx ms, ..." replaces the old flat 0.02 ms.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
# Walk-up: the Plane 9000002 (Scripts/World/WPFly.lua, +X 125 m/s at 50 m, Main+Foliage - WP-SRC-ALTITUDE.scn) is the
# source that reaches the heavy cell; its route must cross HEAVY (the lead places the Plane 250 m before it on -X).
# Frame time: the editor's frame-time HUD (Stat/Profiler overlay) on during this phase - the lead switches it on.
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.ShapeOffset 0,0,0
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда advance 3
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position HEAVY_X,40000,HEAVY_Z-40000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,1
Когда advance 240
# Тогда [кадр]: slice_no_spike - the frame-time graph over the walk-up: no spike above ActivationBudgetMs + the ordinary frame
# while the heavy cell comes in; log "activated in N frames" for it, N > 1; the cell drawn whole, its HLOD gone the same frame.
Тогда slice_no_spike график времени кадра на подходе: нет пика выше ActivationBudgetMs (2 мс) + обычный кадр, пока тяжёлая ячейка входит; в логе «<ячейка> activated in N frames» с N > 1; ячейка появилась целиком, её HLOD исчез в тот же кадр
Когда run Action "Stop"
Дано set 9000001 StreamingSourceData.Enabled true
Дано set 9000002 StreamingSourceData.Enabled false
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 3
# Teleport into the middle of the heavy cell: the cell under the source is not resident, play waits behind the overlay.
Когда set 9000001 Transform.Translation HEAVY_X,HEAVY_Y,HEAVY_Z
Когда advance 1
Когда advance 1
# Тогда [кадр]: slice_physics_ready - the first frame after the block lifts: the player stands on the floor of the cell, does
# not fall through it; log "play waits for it" -> "<cell> activated in N frames ... collision ready" -> "play resumes".
Тогда slice_physics_ready первый кадр после снятия блока: игрок стоит на полу ячейки и не проваливается (Y игрока не падает в следующих кадрах); в логе «play waits for it» → «activated in N frames … collision ready» → «play resumes»
Когда advance 30
Тогда slice_physics_ready_30 через 30 кадров игрок там же на полу, Y не изменился
Когда run Action "Stop"
